id=miuicamera_tanzanite
name=MiuiCamera Universal (AOSP / HyperOS)
version=2.1
versionCode=21
author=gbrsaski20
description=Satu modul MiuiCamera (com.android.camera) untuk semua ROM AOSP/LineageOS/EvoX/HyperOS di tanzanite. Framework compat (getNativeCopy) di-patch di APK, public.libraries-xiaomi.txt + static icon overlay dari ROM donor disertakan, privapp whitelist lengkap, privapp enforcement dilonggarkan, deteksi overlay & konflik paket otomatis, laporan diagnosa di /sdcard/micam_status.txt.
